undershell (1.5.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Clock: automatic Matugen M3 accent from the wallpaper (`accent = "auto"`).
  * Clock: fix m_wall initialization order so the wallpaper accent loads
    immediately on startup and wallpaper change.
  * Noctalia: populate `pal["auto"]` with the wallpaper accent for all widgets.
  * Fedora packages: package undershell-scene in /usr/libexec.
  * Tests: make scene e2e test font-independent for packaging on minimal
    distributions.

 -- EternalSelf-2328 <71615506+EternalSelf-2328@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:18:00 -0500

undershell (1.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Performance profiles: eco, balanced, high, ultra and auto (follows load
    and battery).
  * Wallpaper: one shared picture with a crossfade on change; `msg
    wallpaper-set` sets it through whichever program draws it.
  * Animated wallpaper effects (water, wind, light rays, a 2.5D camera…),
    your own effects folder, painted masks, and effects on every widget.
  * Particles over the wallpaper: snow, rain, petals, fireflies, embers and
    more.
  * Wallpaper Engine scenes and videos, and a wallpaper gallery in the
    editor; with undershell-wall running, scenes are handed to it and their
    properties are set from the inspector.
  * Editor: the gallery grouped by kind; effects and particles added from a
    picker.
  * Music card: a GIF or a video of your own as the cover.
  * A wallpaper filter that changes nothing no longer draws over the
    wallpaper.

 -- EternalSelf-2328 <71615506+EternalSelf-2328@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:45:00 -0500

